<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Polo App - Gay Dating & Connections</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7, #a29bfe);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #6c5ce7;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #dfe6e9;
        }
        container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #6c5ce7;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #2d3436;
            color: white;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Polo App</h1>
        <p>Instant Match, Verified Profiles & Safe Connections</p>
        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.polo.dating&hl=en_IN" class="btn" target="_blank">Download on Google Play</a>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h2 style="text-align: center;">Key Features</h2>
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>⚡ Instant Match</h3>
                <p>Chat directly with other men with no endless swiping required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>🛡️ Safe & Verified</h3>
                <p>Profiles are screen-verified with selfie checks to keep the community secure.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>🎥 Video & Audio</h3>
                <p>Build trust and connect face-to-face before you meet.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Polo App. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
